WEBVTT

00:16:29.503 --> 00:16:33.862
svoju samo-percepciju na neko novo mesto.

00:16:34.369 --> 00:16:40.099
(Muzika)

00:16:40.099 --> 00:16:44.772
♫ Major Tom, kontrolnoj stanici ♫

00:16:44.772 --> 00:16:49.831
♫ Otišao sam zauvek ♫

00:16:49.831 --> 00:16:56.638
♫ I lebdim na najneobičniji način ♫

00:16:56.638 --> 00:17:03.743
♫ I zvezde izgledaju
veoma drugačije danas ♫